<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρακτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do nothing, to be idle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1095b33
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράττειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1325a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gain nothing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>waste one's time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>lose power,</i> of a drug, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				3.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
